<title>GREECE: TABLE-Greek/Bund gap widens to 417bps, flat vs BTP.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Greek/Bund gap widens to 417bps, flat vs BTP.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The spread of Greece's 10-year bond over bunds widened to 417 basis points on Thursday from 415 basis points on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Greek/BTP gap was steady at 335 basis points.</p>
<p>		 CPN     MATURITY  YIELDS    SPREADS    PREVIOUS</p>
<p>								    SPREADS</p>
<p>   GREECE    8.80%   25JUN07    9.67%</p>
<p>   GERMANY   6.0%    04JUL07    5.50%	417	415 bps</p>
<p>   FRANCE    5.5%    25APR07    5.34%	433	430 bps</p>
<p>   ITALY     6.75%   01FEB07    6.32%	335	335 bps</p>
<p>   PORTUGAL  6.63%   23FEB07    6.20%	347	346 bps</p>
<p>   SPAIN     7.35%   31MAR07    6.11%	356	353 bps</p>
<p>   UK	  7.25%   07DEC07    7.04%	263	262 bps</p>
<p>   US	  6.63%   15MAY07    6.23%	344	343 bps</p>
<p>All yields are annualised and based on bid prices at 1018 GMT. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
